  "description": "What held, what broke and what I'm watching next week...",
  "body_html": "<p>We are on the 35th week of the bull market. Even with a few pullbacks, trend remains intact. I have stressed to ignore the news, ignore some of the economic reports and to maintain focus on basic fundamentals combined with price action; regardless your feelings to headlines. Too often I have seen people let go or completely miss, great trades due to a misleading or rage-bait headline.</p><p>If you are new to my page, this is the “StockTok Weekly Wrap”, summarizing everything from the week in case you missed it:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/p-187646479?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Top stocks from 2025 that have pulled back, and which is best today</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-210576068?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Why I think we are still in a bull market</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-213761369?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">My SPECULATION of the market top is around $7800 for the S&amp;P 500</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-212859077?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Bitcoin Rumors are WRONG and price prediction</a></p></li></ul><p>Also, even though it was a relatively quiet week…we do not throw money at price action weakness…one stock did present a buy signal 2/12/2026, and is still within range for a buy. This stock is a longer term position (several months), not a day trade or anything. We have been waiting over a month for the signal:</p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;4e738525-8399-485e-9d74-959e972fb64b&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Very quick update for a stock that just triggered a buy alert. This stock was apart of the StockTok ETF Research conducted on January 14th. We have waited nearly a month for this signal. Our basket of stocks have been crushing the S&amp;P 500, as you can see below.&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:&quot;Read full story&quot;,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Flash Alert: Buy Signal Triggered &quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:301052325,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Investing • Market Analyst • No Politics • 573,000 on TikTok • USNA • Featured on Business Insider &amp; Yahoo Finance • Physical Media Collector 💿&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:1000}],&quot;post_date&quot;:&quot;2026-02-12T14:59:18.829Z&quot;,&quot;cover_image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a3b1d303-888c-4a9f-8bd4-ee66d1eec17b_711x433.png&quot;,&quot;cover_image_alt&quot;:null,&quot;cover_image_crop&quot;:null,&quot;canonical_url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/flash-alert-buy-signal-triggered&quot;,&quot;section_name&quot;:null,&quot;video_upload_id&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:187748656,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;reaction_count&quot;:27,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;publication_id&quot;:3537822,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mLq1!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F96c222d2-04e7-4e47-9e11-4b10f4cee9c4_854x854.png&quot;,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;youtube_url&quot;:null,&quot;show_links&quot;:null,&quot;feed_url&quot;:null}\"></div><p>Going into next week, I am optimistic. Though there is never a guarantee, most stocks were showing green by end of day (we still have an hour to go). A green Friday close most often indicates a green Monday and Tuesday. CPI report came in and headlines are circulating that it slowed (not sure I trust that report)…regardless, it provided a little boost. Not that <em><strong>today’s</strong></em> CPI matters much, as it was priced in several months ago. The VIX has been trending upwards, yet cannot seem to have a breakout AND hold, which is a good thing. Recall, anything above 21 and holding, means I personally do nothing in the markets. In fact I often times will cut or trim positions. It is trending upwards…so something to just continue monitoring. </p><p>Lastly, even with the pullback this week, I continue to be very pleased with the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> which continues to significantly outperform the S&amp;P 500. It was incredibly resilient against the market drop this week. This basket of stocks is Finance sector heavy, with some various tickers added such as real estate, consumer products and energy sprinkled in. To date the ETF is up 7% whereas the S&amp;P 500 is down over -1%. Not bad for 1 month of work. 😏</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png\" width=\"866\" height=\"812\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:812,&quot;width&quot;:866,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:68461,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/187887408?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-Vg6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcec86c9b-6473-4370-842f-19721fffc195_866x812.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>That is all I have for you now, and will have more updates next week. Take time off to stay fresh and in a good attitude! </p><h4>Please LIKE ❤️ and RE-STACK 🔄 this. It is the only way to combat the AI slop flooding social media and only takes you 1 second. Thank you! </h4><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl